index":5,"text":{"ja":"何かあったときはこのラケットが武器になります。実は金属製の特殊仕様になってるんですよ","en":"If anything happens, this racket becomes a weapon. Actually, it's a special metal design."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00678_1/uni00678_1_hom_5.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":6,"text":{"ja":"ふぅ、スポーツで汗をかくっていいですね！　テニスの動きも戦闘に織り込めそうですし、しっかり練習します！","en":"Phew, working up a sweat with sports feels great! I can weave tennis moves into combat, so I'll practice hard!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00678_1/uni00678_1_hom_6.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":7,"text":{"ja":"この格好、いつもと雰囲気が違いますか？　ふええッ！？　いっ、いつにも増して可愛いって何言ってるんですかぁ！","en":"Does this outfit give off a different vibe than usual? Huh!? I—what are you saying, I'm even cuter than ever!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00678_1/uni00678_1_hom_7.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"r18","index":1,"text":{"ja":"ガットに食い込んだおっぱいがエロいだなんて……あうぅ、恥ずかしいこと言わないでください……","en":"Saying that the breasts digging into my gut are erotic… ahh, don't say such embarrassing things…"},"clip":"Audio/Voice_r18/uni00678_1_hom_r18_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"r18","index":2,"text":{"ja":"媚薬ローションのせいです……っ。私、気持ちよくなってなんかいません……！　ああっ、オマンコに指、ダメぇえ！","en":"It's because of the aphrodisiac lotion…! I'm not feeling good at all…! Ah, fingers in my pussy—no!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice_r18/uni00678_1_hom_r18_2.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"r18","index":3,"text":{"ja":"テニスウェアで襲われたからって興奮なんてしませんっ、ハァハァ、オマンコが濡れてるのは……あ、汗です！","en":"Just because I was attacked in tennis wear doesn't make me excited, haah, my pussy's wet… ah, it's sweat!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice_r18/uni00678_1_hom_r18_3.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00678_1/uni00678_1_atk_1.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00678_1/uni00678_1_atk_2.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00678_1